// Stand-ins for Opposing Force and Sven Co-op monsters that Sven Co-op maps
// spawn, built from the Half-Life monsters we have. They let such maps play;
// they don't behave like the real ones. Maps that give a monster its own
// model (squadmaker new_model) still show that model.

